cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This software and data package accompanies a manuscript that is in preparation. It has not been
  published, deposited or assigned a DOI. Please cite the manuscript once it is available; until
  then, cite this package by its version and source revision as recorded in PACKAGE_INFO.json.
title: "TCR-IMAP: homology-controlled evaluation of TCR-MHC contact prediction"
abstract: >-
  Frozen benchmark, partitioning protocols, baselines, stored predictions and analysis code for
  measuring how much of a sequence-based TCR-MHC class I contact predictor's apparent accuracy
  belongs to the evaluation design rather than to the model. 174 curated TCR-peptide-MHC class I
  structures with contact labels and candidate masks keyed by IMGT number and insertion code, five
  partitioning protocols fixed before the reported results were produced, within-fold frequency
  priors, paired per-complex metrics with a clustered bootstrap, comparator reimplementations with a
  deviation table, and a worked example that reproduces the reported pairwise results on a CPU.
type: software
version: 1.0.0-rc1
